Melati emotion classifier: licence

The weights in this repository may be used, reproduced, modified and redistributed for NON-COMMERCIAL RESEARCH
PURPOSES ONLY (research, teaching and publication; not commercial products, services or licensing). Any redistribution
of the weights or of works derived from them must carry this licence.

Why: the training data includes EmoV-DB, licensed for non-commercial purposes (reproduced below), and Expresso
(CC BY-NC 4.0). Every corpus used carries an explicit licence that allows derivative works under these terms:
- EMNS, English, acted (Apache-2.0): https://openslr.org/136/
- Emozionalmente, Italian, crowd-acted (CC BY 4.0): https://zenodo.org/records/6569824
- JL-Corpus, New Zealand English, acted (CC0): https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/tli725/jl-corpus
- MESD, Mexican Spanish, acted (CC BY 4.0): https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/cy34mh68j9/5
- Oreau, French, acted (CC BY 4.0): https://zenodo.org/records/4405783
- RESD, Russian, acted dialogues (MIT): https://huggingface.co/datasets/Aniemore/resd_annotated
- SUBESCO, Bangla, acted (CC BY 4.0): https://zenodo.org/records/4526477
- EmoV-DB, English, acted (EmoV-DB non-commercial licence): https://github.com/numediart/EmoV-DB/blob/master/LICENSE.md
- Expresso, English, read and improvised (CC BY-NC 4.0): https://github.com/facebookresearch/textlesslib/tree/main/examples/expresso/dataset

Excluded on licence grounds: CREMA-D (ODbL), RAVDESS, CaFE and PAVOQUE (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), MELD (GPL-3.0, clipped from a TV series), NonverbalTTS's labels (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), TurEV-DB (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0), and eNTERFACE, EmoDB, ASED, ShEMO and URDU (no licence text).

The encoder is openai/whisper-large-v3 (MIT). The software in this repository is part of Melati
(https://github.com/Scicom-AI-Enterprise-Organization/Melati).

